  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "연결별 인터페이스",
      "items": [
        "R 번호로 사이트 하단과 INTERFACES.html의 이름·타입·송수신 방향·실행 근거를 확인할 수 있습니다."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "타입과 방향",
      "items": [
        "프로젝트 타입의 공통 접두사: contact_scan_interfaces/msg, /srv, /action.",
        "토픽 화살표: publisher → subscriber. 서비스·액션 화살표: client → server; 응답·feedback·result는 같은 ROS 호출의 역방향이다.",
        "/robot/sample: RobotSample → contact_detector, safety_monitor, scan_manager, weld_manager, mqtt_bridge.",
        "/robot/status: RobotStatus → safety_monitor, scan_manager, weld_manager, mqtt_bridge.",
        "/contact/event: ContactEvent — contact_detector와 robot_manager가 발행. scan_manager, robot_manager, mqtt_bridge가 구독. robot_manager의 발행은 step SLIDE EDGE 경로.",
        "/scan/state: ScanState → contact_detector, weld_manager, mqtt_bridge; /scan/result: ScanResult 및 /scan/log: ScanLog → mqtt_bridge.",
        "/weld/state: WeldState → scan_manager, mqtt_bridge; /weld/result: WeldResult 및 /weld/log: ScanLog → mqtt_bridge.",
        "/safety/status: SafetyStatus → scan_manager, weld_manager, mqtt_bridge."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "액션과 서비스",
      "items": [
        "/scan/run: RunScan; /scan/home: ReturnHome; /scan/resume: Resume — mqtt_bridge client → scan_manager server.",
        "/scan/stop: StopScan; /scan/set_config: SetConfig — mqtt_bridge → scan_manager.",
        "/weld/run: RunWeld; /weld/home: ReturnHome; /weld/stop: StopWeld — mqtt_bridge → weld_manager.",
        "/robot/execute_motion: ExecuteMotion — scan_manager와 weld_manager → robot_manager.",
        "/robot/execute_path: ExecutePath — weld_manager → robot_manager.",
        "/robot/stop: StopRobot — scan_manager, weld_manager, safety_monitor → robot_manager.",
        "/contact/tare: TareForce — scan_manager → contact_detector; /safety/reset: ResetSafety — mqtt_bridge → safety_monitor.",
        "/{robot_manager,contact_detector,safety_monitor}/{set_parameters,get_parameters}: rcl_interfaces/srv/{SetParameters,GetParameters} — scan_manager client, rclpy 표준 server."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "외부 드라이버 / MQTT",
      "items": [
        "JointState 기본값은 /dsr01/joint_states. joint_state_topic 파라미터로 변경 가능. 외부 발행자를 코드만으로 단일 노드로 확정하지 않았다.",
        "dsr_msgs2: GetCurrentPosx, GetToolForce, GetRobotState; MoveLine, MoveJoint, MoveSplineTask, MoveStop; TaskComplianceCtrl, ReleaseComplianceCtrl, SetDesiredForce, ReleaseForce.",
        "서비스 경로 /dsr01/dsr_controller2/{aux_control,system,motion,force}/*; dsr_namespace는 real.yaml에서 dsr01.",
        "MQTT JSON: robot/sample, robot/status, robot/joints, robot/gripper_joints, scan/state, scan/result, scan/log, scan/command_result, weld/state, weld/result, weld/log, weld/command_result, contact/event, safety/status, cmd/ack, hb/ros, conn/ros.",
        "cmd/scan/start→/scan/run; home→/scan/home; resume→/scan/resume; stop→/scan/stop; set_config→/scan/set_config. cmd/weld/start→/weld/run; home→/weld/home; stop→/weld/stop. cmd/safety/reset→/safety/reset.",
        "hb/web→/web/heartbeat: WebHeartbeat 구현. 현재 subscriber 없음. 연결된 완성 경로로 표시하지 않았다."
      ]
    }
  ],
